<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A11" title="In Semantic Tube Prediction: Beating LLM Data Efficiency with JEPA" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">K </span>Tuning <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A12" title="In Semantic Tube Prediction: Beating LLM Data Efficiency with JEPA" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">L </span>Ablation</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
